      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَضْحَلٌ</span></b>  The <i>place of a</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ضَحْل</span>: (M, TA:) or <i>a
place in which is little water:</i> (O, K:) the mirage
(<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَرَاب</span>) is likened thereto: (TA:) pl. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَضَاحِلُ</span>;
(O, TA;) to which Ru-beh, (O,) or El-'Ajjáj,
(TA,) likens clouds. (O, * TA.)

